  "description": "A spicy and satisfying Kenyan dish featuring chestnuts, ferment-kimchi, and ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients, perfect for a crowd-pleasing dinner. This recipe combines the warmth of chestnuts with the tang of kimchi and the comfort of a rich curry sauce.",
