  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chestnuts, kimchi, and coconut milk, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 15 minutes, or until the chestnuts are tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
